 "stimulus_html": "<p>For the following problems, answer these questions:\n</p><ol type=\"a\">\n<li>Is there a curved pattern in the data? If yes, stop here.</li>\n<li>Classify the strength and direction of the relationship. Make a guess at the value of <span data-math=\"r\">r</span>.</li>\n</ol><p></p>\n",
 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 531603,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "<img src=\"exercises/media/37b29ab44cf38c4e.jpg\" alt=\" A scatter plot. The x-axis ranges from 20 to 70, in increments of 10. The y-axis ranges from 92 to 104, in increments of 2. The scatter plot shows the points arranged in the form of an open downward parabola and some of the points are as follows: (30, 94), (35, 97), (40, 99), (45, 100), (50, 101), (55, 100), and (95, 95). The region between 40 and 60 on the horizontal axis has more points. Note: all values are approximate.\">\n",
